 533:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_pwr.c **** /**
 534:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_pwr.c ****   * @brief Indicates Sleep-On-Exit when returning from Handler mode to Thread mode. 
